(text "SN64 v2 RISER - passive: N64 cartridge edge (SummerCart64 reference geometry, CERN-OHL-S-2.0) to a 2x20 2.00 mm right-angle header. Header pins 1-27 = N64 bus, 28-31 = HOST_3V3, 32-40 = GND. 12 V, audio, video sync, key pins end here." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f58dd4d0-0ae9-54da-ae36-5b1dac9ce0da"))
